OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAll parts will have a dry day
OL,6,Falthough it will be rather cloudy at
OL,7,Ftimes. A few bright or sunny spells
OL,8,Fbreaking through. Light winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry.
OL,11,FThen the rest of the night will be dry
OL,12,Fwith variable amounts of cloud and
OL,13,Fsome clear periods. Light winds.
OL,14,
OL,15,CMonday:FAfter a cloudy start all parts
OL,16,Fwill have a dry day with some good
OL,17,Fspells of sunshine. Feeling warm, but
OL,18,Fa cooler onshore breeze along the east
OL,19,Fcoast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
